  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell originated among the armies of Heaven. Choose a\nspecific subtype of evil outsider when you cast this spell, such\nas daemon, demon, devil, or div. All manufactured weapons in\nthe area of effect bypass the DR of that type of outsider. The\nweapons do not become aligned or change composition.",
